[{"data":1,"prerenderedAt":110},["ShallowReactive",2],{"news-detail-ibrahim-adedamola-adesoye-iaa-kwara-state-scholarship-program-2026-apply-now-133":3},{"news":4,"more":27},{"id":5,"slug":6,"title":7,"content":8,"authorName":9,"authorId":10,"status":11,"recommended":12,"datePosted":13,"deadline":14,"images":15,"notifiedAt":14,"notifiedBy":14,"createdAt":13,"updatedAt":21,"categories":22,"readTime":24},133,"ibrahim-adedamola-adesoye-iaa-kwara-state-scholarship-program-2026-apply-now-133","Ibrahim Adedamola Adesoye Iaa Kwara State Scholarship Program 2026: Apply Now","\u003Cp>Are you an undergraduate Kwara Indigene  looking for a scholarship programme to support your undergraduate sojourn?\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>This opportunity (IAA Kwara State Scholarship Program) is for you!\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>\u003Cstrong>IAA Kwara State Scholarship Program Abstract\u003C\u002Fstrong>\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cul>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Scholarship Host: Ibrahim Adedamola Adesoye IAA x Dream Code\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Location: Kwara State, Nigeria\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Category: \u003Ca href=\"https:\u002F\u002Fscholarsworld.ng\u002Fscholarships\u002F?utm_source=Google&amp;utm_medium=Catergory&amp;utm_campaign=Email+Campaign\">Scholarships\u003C\u002Fa> || \u003Ca href=\"https:\u002F\u002Fscholarsworld.ng\u002Fscholarships\u002Fundergraduate-scholarships\u002F?utm_source=Google&amp;utm_medium=Catergory&amp;utm_campaign=Email+Campaign\">Undergraduate Scholarships\u003C\u002Fa> \u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Benefits: Full Scholarship\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cul>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Tuition\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Allowance\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Mentorship\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Networking\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Hands on project\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003C\u002Ful>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Eligibility: Kwara State\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Deadline: April 30, 2026\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003C\u002Ful>\u003Cp>\u003Cstrong>Ibrahim Adedamola Adesoye IAA Kwara State Scholarship Program 2026 Details\u003C\u002Fstrong>\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>The I.A.A Kwara State Scholarship is designed to support brilliant and resilient undergraduates from underserved communities in Kwara State who are enrolled in a tertiary institution in Kwara State.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>This is in partnership with DreamCode Africa as part of a shared commitment to support students who demonstrate academic dedication and strong potential but may face financial barriers in pursuing their education.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>\u003Cstrong>IAA Kwara State Scholarship Program 2026 Benefits\u003C\u002Fstrong>\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>IAA Kwara State Scholarship Program 2026 offers:\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cul>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Financial support for academic pursuit\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Access to mentorship opportunities\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Community network of scholars\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Supervised execution of social impact project\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003C\u002Ful>\u003Cp>\u003Cstrong>Ibrahim Adedamola Adesoye (I.A.A) Kwara State Scholarship Programme Requirements\u003C\u002Fstrong>\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>To be eligible for the Ibrahim Adedamola Adesoye (I.A.A) Kwara State Scholarship Programme, applicants must satisfy the following conditions:\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cul>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Applicants must be Indigenes of Kwara state and students studying in any federal or state tertiary institution In Kwara state.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Be an indigene of Kwara State. (added advantage if you are from Irepodun LGA)\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003C\u002Ful>\u003Cp>Be enrolled in either a federal or state university in Kwara State\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cul>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Maintain a 3.0 CGPA at the end of each academic session.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Have no more than one carryover course.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Submit compelling essays and provide all documents required.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003C\u002Ful>\u003Cp>\u003Cstrong>IAA Kwara State Scholarship Program Required Documents\u003C\u002Fstrong>\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>While applying for the 2026 IAA Kwara State Scholarship Program, you will be required to submit the following documents;\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cul>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Original copy of your state of origin Certificate\u003Cbr \u002F>\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp> Student ID Card or Admission Letter\u003Cbr \u002F>\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp> most recent result showing your CGPA\u002FGPA\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>\u003Cstrong>Study abroad programs\u003C\u002Fstrong>\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003C\u002Ful>\u003Cp>\u003Cstrong>How To Apply for IAA Kwara State Scholarship Program\u003C\u002Fstrong>\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>To apply for the IAA Kwara State Scholarship Program, follow the instructions we have outlined below; \u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cul>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Read the information we have provided on this webpage and ensure your eligibility\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Prepare All required documents\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Fill in the application form\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003C\u002Ful>\u003Cp>AAPLY HERE: \u003Ca href=\"https:\u002F\u002Fdocs.google.com\u002Fforms\u002Fd\u002Fe\u002F1FAIpQLScJYNtBme5WNi-eALu3p0jgoCnID-gAFgaFvf2SBBqBLQetMw\u002Fviewform\">https:\u002F\u002Fdocs.google.com\u002Fforms\u002Fd\u002Fe\u002F1FAIpQLScJYNtBme5WNi-eALu3p0jgoCnID-gAFgaFvf2SBBqBLQetMw\u002Fviewform\u003C\u002Fa>\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>\u003C\u002Fp>","Linkskool",16,"published",0,"2026-04-13 16:01:25",null,[16],{"fileName":17,"oldFileName":17,"type":18,"file":19,"url":20},"assets\u002Felearning\u002Flrm\u002Fexplore\u002Fnews\u002Fibrahim-adedamola-adesoye-iaa-kwara-state-scholarship-program-2026-apply-now\u002F69dd0545d76d84.81501367_screenshot 2026-04-13 155423.png","image","","https:\u002F\u002Flinkskool.com\u002Fassets\u002Felearning\u002Flrm\u002Fexplore\u002Fnews\u002Fibrahim-adedamola-adesoye-iaa-kwara-state-scholarship-program-2026-apply-now\u002F69dd0545d76d84.81501367_screenshot%202026-04-13%20155423.png","2026-06-24 11:55:43",[23],{"id":24,"name":25,"createdAt":26},2,"Opportunities","2026-01-07 13:35:07",[28,38,48,57,66,75,84,93,101],{"id":29,"slug":30,"title":31,"images":32,"datePosted":36,"authorName":37},305,"dartmouth-college-kings-scholarship-usa-2026-fully-funded-opportunity","Dartmouth College Kings Scholarship Usa 2026: Fully Funded Opportunity",[33],{"fileName":34,"oldFileName":34,"type":18,"file":19,"url":35},"assets\u002Felearning\u002Flrm\u002Fexplore\u002Fnews\u002Fdartmouth-college-kings-scholarship-usa-2026-fully-funded-opportunity\u002F6a3c3537be16a2.95289717_screenshot 2026-06-24 204255.png","https:\u002F\u002Flinkskool.com\u002Fassets\u002Felearning\u002Flrm\u002Fexplore\u002Fnews\u002Fdartmouth-college-kings-scholarship-usa-2026-fully-funded-opportunity\u002F6a3c3537be16a2.95289717_screenshot%202026-06-24%20204255.png","2026-06-24 20:51:19","LINKSKOOL",{"id":39,"slug":40,"title":41,"images":42,"datePosted":46,"authorName":47},304,"mexican-government-scholarship-for-foreigners-2026-fully-funded-opportunity","Mexican Government Scholarship For Foreigners 2026: Fully Funded Opportunity",[43],{"fileName":44,"oldFileName":44,"type":18,"file":19,"url":45},"assets\u002Felearning\u002Flrm\u002Fexplore\u002Fnews\u002Fmexican-government-scholarship-for-foreigners-2026-fully-funded-opportunity\u002F6a3c32aaeb8a11.62235495_screenshot 2026-06-24 201924.png","https:\u002F\u002Flinkskool.com\u002Fassets\u002Felearning\u002Flrm\u002Fexplore\u002Fnews\u002Fmexican-government-scholarship-for-foreigners-2026-fully-funded-opportunity\u002F6a3c32aaeb8a11.62235495_screenshot%202026-06-24%20201924.png","